 560:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****                                              Note: This parameter must be set to set to independent
 561:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h **** 
 562:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****                                              This feature can be modified afterwards using unitary 
 563:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h **** 
