1522:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Example:
1523:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB(LL_ADC_CHANNEL_4)
1524:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           will return decimal number "4".
