5225:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (1) On SR5E1, parameter available only on ADC instances: ADC1, ADC5.\n
5226:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (2) On SR5E1, parameter available only on ADC instances: ADC2, ADC4.\n
