5832:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC oversampling shift
5833:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *        (impacting both ADC groups regular and injected)
5834:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll CFGR2    OVSS           LL_ADC_GetOverSamplingShift
